# Secrets. Nothing has leaked here — this is preventive. A .env is the usual
# place credentials land locally, and there was no rule stopping a commit.
# The README documents a `gcloud secrets versions access` call, so anyone
# following it is one convenience step away from writing one of these.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Hugo build output
public/
resources/_gen/
.hugo_build.lock

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
